prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay.md:143:Search space is the set of meaningful candidates the system may consider for the current decision.
prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay.md:146:A branch is a distinct reasoning or action trajectory derived from a candidate.
prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay.md:149:Pruning is the deliberate elimination of lower-value candidates or branches to keep search bounded and focused.
prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay.md:151:### 3.8 Reasoning Depth
